{"availability":"available","full":"InsightSoftwareConsortium/ITKElastix","name":"ITKElastix","description":"An ITK Python interface to elastix, a toolbox for rigid and nonrigid registration of images","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":287,"forks":30,"created":"2019-09-10T02:54:40Z","updated":"2026-10-08T19:58:05Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://insightsoftwareconsortium.github.io/ITKElastix/","topics":["itk","itk-module"],"demo":"https://insightsoftwareconsortium.github.io/ITKElastix/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:38.992Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:38.992Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:38.992Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T19:51:38.992Z","stars":287,"forks":30}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Provides an ITK Python, JavaScript, and WebAssembly interface to elastix, a toolbox for rigid and nonrigid registration of images.","elastix is open source software, based on the well-known Insight Toolkit (ITK). The software consists of a collection of algorithms that are commonly used to solve (medical) image registration problems. The modular design of elastix allows the user to quickly configure, test, and compare different registration methods for a specific application.","The demo performs affine registration with elastix entirely in the browser: it takes OME-Zarr, OME-TIFF, or any ITK-readable images as input, renders the fixed, moving, and registered images with niivue, and writes the registered image and the fixed-to-moving transform back out as OME-Zarr."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/InsightSoftwareConsortium/ITKElastix/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"cf00f960656223ded08c9db96b3d9a3a3c7dfbc6dcc0203ad50d5b4cd2ef3207","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:39.112Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T19:51:39.112Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Provides an ITK Python, JavaScript, and We